cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Dual-Parameter Synergy–Sensitivity Profiling Framework for Epigenetic-Targeted Drug Combinations"
abstract: >-
  Open-source code and data accompanying the manuscript "Dual-Parameter Profiling of
  Synergistic and Antagonistic Epigenetic-Targeted Drug Combinations in Cancer"
  (Journal of Cheminformatics, submitted). Implements a dual-parameter framework that
  jointly quantifies drug-combination synergy (HSA, Bliss, Loewe, ZIP via SynergyFinder 2.0)
  and sensitivity (Combination Sensitivity Score, CSS) and applies a dual-threshold filter
  to reduce false positives.
